---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Support the work — Papua Open Source"
  description="Use our projects, share useful feedback, or support their upkeep. A little care goes a long way."
>
  <section class="section surface">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Support the work</p>
      <h1>Like what we’re making?</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Use it, tell a friend about it, or let us know when something breaks.
        That already helps.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container story narrow">
      <h2>Spotted something?</h2>
      <p>
        Maybe a word looks wrong, a link is broken, or a page is hard to use.
        Tell us what you found and where. A screenshot or a source helps too.
      </p>
      <p>
        Thinking of a bigger change? Read the project’s notes and have a chat
        with us first. We can tell you whether it fits what we’re working on.
      </p>
      <a class="action secondary" href="/contact/">
        Get in touch
      </a>
      <h2>Make something of your own.</h2>
      <p>
        Have a look at the code. If the license allows it, you can change it to
        suit yourself or use it to start something new.
      </p>
      <h2>Help us keep going.</h2>
      <p>
        If something we’ve made has helped you out, you can send a little thanks
        through Trakteer.
      </p>
      <a class="action" href="https://trakteer.id/papuaopensource">
        Support us on Trakteer ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
